# T2.4 — Corrected DBRepo View Creation Notebook

## Goal

This notebook creates denormalized ML-ready DBRepo views for the FAIR Data Science assignment.

The implementation:

- Uses DBRepo REST API + Python SDK
- Uses `QueryDefinition` correctly
- Uses fully-qualified `table.column` notation
- Uses flat column lists (NOT nested lists)
- Creates reusable helper functions
- Validates the created views
- Avoids the earlier NumPy / inhomogeneous-shape errors

